From 60aa0e441cd321bdb0298caf6fa4f656ee7082f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 30 Mar 2026 13:45:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 49/63] Revert "[cuttlefish] Add --enable_qemu_display flag for
 headless macOS operation"

Summary:
This reverts commit 3534dead42cefb894b9a6046f4cfe78def14c2fc.

We don't need this. We can run qemu with cococa window in paragon pods.

Test Plan:
```
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz
```

Reviewers: josephknox, #wearables_emulators, hzalek

Reviewed By: josephknox

Subscribers: #wearables_emulators

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D98793915

Tags: aarch64
